,"seed":1008,"version":2,"versionNonce":1825899762,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"a7"},{"id":"t-leg","type":"text","x":1142,"y":295,"width":300,"height":88,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#495057","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":1009,"version":2,"versionNonce":983530286,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"A view = a named, checked-in SELECT.\nNo storage, no refresh, no runtime cost\n— BigQuery inlines it at query time.\nTables (violet) are real stored state.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"A view = a named, checked-in SELECT.\nNo storage, no refresh, no runtime cost\n— BigQuery inlines it at query time.\nTables (violet) are real stored state.","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"a8","autoResize":true},{"id":"b-pd","type":"rectangle","x":120,"y":575,"width":460,"height":205,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2f9e44","backgroundColor":"#d3f9d8","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"seed":1010,"version":2,"versionNonce":1569429170,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"a9"},{"id":"t-pd","type":"text","x":135,"y":587,"width":430,"height":180,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":1011,"version":2,"versionNonce":1134814574,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"billing.attribution_priced_deltas  (view)\nWHAT IS IT WORTH — rates as-of event_date, never\nthe observation date. Base = direct + halo sales.\ncommission_rate = product_commission (default lane)\n  → brand_commission (org default)\n  → NULL = UNPRICED (alert!) — the program floor\n     NEVER prices; missing config must be loud\nusage_rate = brand_usage_rate (org row per program)","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"billing.attribution_priced_deltas  (view)\nWHAT IS IT WORTH — rates as-of event_date, never\nthe observation date. Base = direct + halo sales.\ncommission_rate = product_commission (default lane)\n  → brand_commission (org default)\n  → NULL = UNPRICED (alert!) — the program floor\n     NEVER prices; missing config must be loud\nusage_rate = brand_usage_rate (org row per program)","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aA","autoResize":true},{"id":"b-ccl","type":"rectangle","x":640,"y":575,"width":440,"height":135,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#868e96","backgroundColor":"#f8f9fa","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"dashed","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"seed":1012,"version":2,"versionNonce":621408370,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"aB"},{"id":"t-ccl","type":"text","x":655,"y":587,"width":410,"height":110,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#495057","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":1013,"version":2,"versionNonce":2099316654,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"cc_priced_deltas — LATER (not built)\nNeeds: CC overlap feed (WAY-1948) for difference\nnetting  max(commission − cc_overlap, 0)\n+ creator resolution (yellow note below).","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"cc_priced_deltas — LATER (not built)\nNeeds: CC overlap feed (WAY-1948) for difference\nnetting  max(commission − cc_overlap, 0)\n+ creator resolution (yellow note below).","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aC","autoResize":true},{"id":"b-run","type":"rectangle","x":250,"y":880,"width":800,"height":190,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#e8590c","backgroundColor":"#ffe8cc","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"seed":1014,"version":2,"versionNonce":655823410,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"aD"},{"id":"t-run","type":"text","x":265,"y":892,"width":770,"height":165,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":1015,"version":2,"versionNonce":1195368942,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"BILLING RUN — Temporal workflow, monthly ~2nd  (#2489)\n1. WATERMARK GATE: every source's event log ingested past cutoff — else FAIL LOUDLY (never sleep)\n2. DELETE own run → INSERT the window  to_ingest_time ∈ (start, cutoff]  aggregated to line grain\n    (product × event_date × creator) — idempotent retries\n3. Tie-out assert (Σ commission ≡ Σ payout + Σ held) → write billing_run row LAST\n    (row exists ⇔ run completed)\nOne run per period · run_id = billing-<period> · summary counts alert-only until rates seeded","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"BILLING RUN — Temporal workflow, monthly ~2nd  (#2489)\n1. WATERMARK GATE: every source's event log ingested past cutoff — else FAIL LOUDLY (never sleep)\n2. DELETE own run → INSERT the window  to_ingest_time ∈ (start, cutoff]  aggregated to line grain\n    (product × event_date × creator) — idempotent retries\n3. Tie-out assert (Σ commission ≡ Σ payout + Σ held) → write billing_run row LAST\n    (row exists ⇔ run completed)\nOne run per period · run_id = billing-<period> · summary counts alert-only until rates seeded","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aE","autoResize":true},{"id":"b-il","type":"rectangle","x":140,"y":1150,"width":460,"height":145,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#7048e8","backgroundColor":"#e5dbff","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"seed":1016,"version":2,"versionNonce":916061170,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"aF"},{"id":"t-il","type":"text","x":155,"y":1162,"width":430,"height":120,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":1017,"version":2,"versionNonce":352941102,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"billing.invoice_line  (TABLE — the ledger)\nWhat we BOOKED. Deletion-protected,\npartitioned by period. One row per\nproduct × event_date × creator per run.\ncreator_ref = 'UNRESOLVED' in v1 ──┐","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"billing.invoice_line  (TABLE — the ledger)\nWhat we BOOKED. Deletion-protected,\npartitioned by period. One row per\nproduct × event_date × creator per run.\ncreator_ref = 'UNRESOLVED' in v1 ──┐","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aG","autoResize":true},{"id":"b-br","type":"rectangle","x":740,"y":1150,"width":420,"height":145,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#7048e8","backgroundColor":"#e5dbff","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"seed":1018,"version":2,"versionNonce":832155058,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"aH"},{"id":"t-br","