 (view)\nSlice by CUSTOMER\n(org × period): what each\norg owes. Feeds invoice_doc /\nStripe rollup. No stored\nheader → totals can't drift.","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aK","autoResize":true},{"id":"b-v2","type":"rectangle","x":360,"y":1380,"width":300,"height":165,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#0c8599","backgroundColor":"#c5f6fa","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"seed":1022,"version":2,"versionNonce":1103849778,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"aL"},{"id":"t-v2","type":"text","x":372,"y":1392,"width":280,"height":140,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":1023,"version":2,"versionNonce":568359662,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"creator_payout_agg  (view)\nThe SAME lines, sliced by\nCREATOR: what we owe each\ncreator. Excludes UNRESOLVED.\nPayouts = a regrouping of the\nbilled lines, by construction.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"creator_payout_agg  (view)\nThe SAME lines, sliced by\nCREATOR: what we owe each\ncreator. Excludes UNRESOLVED.\nPayouts = a regrouping of the\nbilled lines, by construction.","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aM","autoResize":true},{"id":"b-v3","type":"rectangle","x":680,"y":1380,"width":300,"height":165,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#0c8599","backgroundColor":"#c5f6fa","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"seed":1024,"version":2,"versionNonce":1185641202,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"aN"},{"id":"t-v3","type":"text","x":692,"y":1392,"width":280,"height":140,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":1025,"version":2,"versionNonce":1647242542,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"held_lines  (view)\nBilled to the brand, payee\nunknown (UNRESOLVED).\nKnown amount / unknown\ncreator — stays visible until\nidentity resolves. ⚠ see note","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"held_lines  (view)\nBilled to the brand, payee\nunknown (UNRESOLVED).\nKnown amount / unknown\ncreator — stays visible until\nidentity resolves. ⚠ see note","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aO","autoResize":true},{"id":"b-v4","type":"rectangle","x":1000,"y":1380,"width":300,"height":165,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#0c8599","backgroundColor":"#c5f6fa","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"seed":1026,"version":2,"versionNonce":1315194034,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"aP"},{"id":"t-v4","type":"text","x":1012,"y":1392,"width":280,"height":140,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":1027,"version":2,"versionNonce":1819613038,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"unpriced_lines  (view)\nObserved money we can't bill\nright: no rate (missing config)\nor no org (no billable owner).\nALERT surface — should trend\nto 0 after rate seeding.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"unpriced_lines  (view)\nObserved money we can't bill\nright: no rate (missing config)\nor no org (no billable owner).\nALERT surface — should trend\nto 0 after rate seeding.","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aQ","autoResize":true},{"id":"b-note","type":"rectangle","x":680,"y":1610,"width":640,"height":215,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#f08c00","backgroundColor":"#fff3bf","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"seed":1028,"version":2,"versionNonce":312270450,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"aR"},{"id":"t-note","type":"text","x":695,"y":1622,"width":610,"height":190,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":1029,"version":2,"versionNonce":419166638,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"⚠ OPEN DECISION — creator migration (plan §9, undecided)\nconnect_expert_id reference  vs  stub creator accounts  vs  case-by-case.\nGates: creator_ref resolution (CC name → account mapping — build on\nSalvador's acc_creator_name work), per-creator rate overrides,\ncreator_enablement vetoes, CC pricing, and all payouts.\nUntil decided: every line is UNRESOLVED → held bucket.\nBrand invoices are still correct meanwhile (product-default rates —\nrate is separated from payee by design).","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"⚠ OPEN DECISION — creator migration (plan §9, undecided)\nconnect_expert_id reference  vs  stub creator accounts  vs  case-by-case.\nGates: creator_ref resolution (CC name → account mapping — build on\nSalvador's acc_creator_name work), per-creator rate overrides,\ncreator_enablement vetoes, CC pricing, and all payouts.\nUntil decided: every line is UNRESOLVED → held bucket.\nBrand invoices are still correct meanwhile (product-default rates —\nrate is separated from payee by design).","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aS","autoResize":true},{"id":"b-ds","type":"rectangle","x":60,"y":1640,"width":560,"height":150,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#868e96","backgroundColor":"#f1f3f5","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"dashed","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"seed":1030,"version":2,"versionNonce":1851442,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"index":"aT"},{"id":"t-ds","type":"text","x":75,"y":1652,"width":530,"height":125,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#495057","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":1031,"version":2,"versionNonce":1324127214,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1783814305221,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"DOWNSTREAM (Phase 2+, not built)\nPostgres invoice_doc: per org × period, pins run_id,\ndraft → issued → paid/void, Stripe invoice id\n→ payout_item: accrued → payable (on invoice.paid) → paid\n→ Stripe: Customer = org (money in) · Connect transfers (money out)","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"DOWNSTREAM (Phase 2+, not built)\nPostgres invoice_doc: per org × period, pins run_id,\ndraft → issued → paid/void, Stripe invoice id\n→ payout_item: accrued → payable (on invoice.paid) → paid\n→ Stripe: Customer = org (money in) · Connect transfers (money out)","lineHeight":1.25,"index":"aU","autoResize":true},{"id":"a1","type":"arrow","x":480,"y":187,"width":130,"height":89,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":2},"seed":1032,"version":2,"versionNonce":13889315